<h2 id="faq">Frequently asked questions</h2>
<h3>I made a change and don't see it on the site.</h3>
<p>Make sure you saved the record ("Guardar"/"Save" button). If it's an offer or announcement, check that it's <strong>Active</strong> and that today's date falls within the configured date range. If it's a text field, remember that an empty field shows the site's built-in default text, not an error.</p>
<h3>How do I change the order rooms, services, or activities appear in?</h3>
<p>Use each record's <strong>Position</strong> field. The lowest number shows first.</p>
<h3>What image size should I use?</h3>
<p>Horizontal photos at least 1200 pixels wide look good on any screen. Avoid very large files (over 5 MB) so the site keeps loading quickly.</p>
<h3>I forgot my password.</h3>
<p>On the sign-in screen (<code>/users/sign_in</code>) use the "Forgot your password?" link. If the email doesn't arrive, ask another admin to reset it for you.</p>
